WEBVTT

0
00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:04.460
Sprezzature is an AI engine for Design.

1
00:00:04.660 --> 00:00:07.740
10 tools, to make good design
and to check it.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.625
Most design rules were written down
by experts, years ago.

3
00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:18.600
Contrast, colour blindness, the laws
of attention. Your tools ignore all of it.

4
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:23.360
This suite turns those rules into tools.

5
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:28.959
Charts, maps, colours,
captions, pages and forms.

6
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.320
The same rules work both ways.

7
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:40.687
To make something new,
and to check what is already online.

8
00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:48.879
And the one thing no rule can do:
look at the result.

9
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:54.320
A model on your machine looks
at the picture, like a designer would.

10
00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:57.880
What gets fixed is the code,
never the picture.

11
00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:02.275
Everything runs on your own machine.
Nothing is sent anywhere.

12
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:11.200
Star it on GitHub,
and find the suite on sprezzature.ai.

13
00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:14.360
Make it, audit it, take a look at it.
